Merhabalar,

Malum sebepten ötürü ekranın karşısında tüm pozisyonlarımı yönetmekle meşgul olduğum için ancak buraya bakabiliyorum. Çok fazla kişi tag’lemiş, yardım istemiş.

Öncelikle umarım zararlar makul seviyededir&quot;</h1><!--$--><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[600px]" id="urt:conversation:1976799800013025643:none:default"><ul><li><div><div class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-500 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 px-horizontal py-vertical border-b border-gray-100"><article class="flex flex-col gap-1" data-tweet-id="1976799800013025643" itemID="https://x.com/i/status/1976799800013025643" itemScope="" itemType="https://schema.org/SocialMediaPosting"><meta content="2025-10-10T23:59:34.000Z" itemProp="dateCreated"/><meta content="2025-10-10T23:59:34.000Z" itemProp="datePublished"/><meta content="https://x.com/Efloud/status/1976799800013025643" itemProp="url"/><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex w-10 shrink-0 justify-center self-stretch"><div class="relative z-10"><a class="" href="/Efloud"><div class="shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-300 rounded-full size-10 transition duration-200 hover:brightness-90"><img alt="user avatar" class="size-full object-cover" draggable="false" loading="lazy" sizes="40px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_normal.jpg" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_mini.jpg 24w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_normal.jpg 48w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_bigger.jpg 73w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_x96.jpg 96w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_reasonably_small.jpg 128w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_200x200.jpg 200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_400x400.jpg 400w"/></div></a></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="overflow-hidden flex-col 